<title>USA: MasterCard will add postage stamp service to ATMs.</title>
<headline>MasterCard will add postage stamp service to ATMs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>MasterCard International Inc said on Thursday it will make it possible for members of its Cirrus network to offer packets of postage stamps and other products out of automated teller machines.</p>
<p>It would be up to the individual banks whether to charge a premium for the stamps, MasterCard said.</p>
<p>The stamp service will be offered beginning in the second quarter of 1997. Other products that may be offered later through ATMs include phone cards, travelers' checks, coupons and transportation cards.</p>
</text>
